# 🐸 Meme Clicker Tycoon

> A satirical clicker game about the absurdity of internet fame. Click the frog, build your meme empire!

![Game Screenshot](screenshots/desktop.png)

---

## 🎮 Live Demo

**[Play the game →](https://YOUR_USERNAME.github.io/meme-clicker-tycoon/)**

---

## ✨ Features

| Feature | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| 🪙 Click to earn | Click the frog to earn meme coins |
| 📈 5 upgrades | Each with exponential scaling and max levels |
| 🎲 Random events | Good & bad events keep it interesting |
| 💾 Auto-save | Saves every 15 seconds + on page close |
| 📱 Responsive | Works on desktop, tablet, and mobile |
| 🏠 PWA support | Installable on mobile devices |
| ⌨️ Keyboard shortcuts | Space to click, Ctrl+S to save |

---

## 🧠 Design Decisions

### Why vanilla JavaScript?
The game is self-contained with zero dependencies. It loads instantly, works offline, and has no external API calls. This makes it easy to review, run, and modify.

### Why localStorage?
No server needed — perfect for a clicker game where all progress is client-side. Saves are automatic and work offline.

### Why this upgrade curve?
Each upgrade has a 1.5x–2.2x cost multiplier to create satisfying exponential growth. Max levels prevent infinite scaling and give players a sense of completion.

### Why PWA?
Adding a manifest and service worker shows understanding of modern web standards. It makes the game installable on phones and work offline — bonus points for a junior role.

