## 🏗️ Architecture
┌─────────────┐
│ Game State │ ← single source of truth
└──────┬──────┘
│
▼
┌─────────────┐
│ Render() │ ← updates DOM from state
└──────┬──────┘
│
▼
┌─────────────┐
│ User Input │ ← clicks, upgrades, buttons
└──────┬──────┘
│
▼
┌─────────────┐
│ Update State│ ← modify state, re-render
└──────┬──────┘
│
▼
┌─────────────┐
│ Save/Load │ ← localStorage persistence
└─────────────┘

