## 🚀 How to Run

### Option 1: Open directly (no server needed)
1. Clone the repo:
   ```bash
   git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/meme-clicker-tycoon.git
   cd meme-clicker-tycoon
2. Open index.html in any browser

3. Start clicking! 🐸

### Option 2: Local server (optional)
# Using Python
python3 -m http.server 8000
# Then open http://localhost:8000


### Option 3: GitHub Pages (recommended)
Push to GitHub

Go to Settings → Pages

Select main branch and save

Your game is live at username.github.io/meme-clicker-tycoon/

🎯 Game Progression
Milestone	Goal
🌱 Start	Click the frog to earn coins
🔧 First upgrade	Buy "Better Meme" (10 coins)
⚡ Passive income	Buy "Social Media" (50 coins)
🏭 Scaling	Buy "Meme Factory" (200 coins)
🚀 Exponential	Buy "Viral Boost" (1000 coins)
⭐ Endgame	Max out all upgrades
